  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n⇒ [ ( 5(1)/(2) )² right. - left. ( 2(3)/(4) )² ]~ ÷ 2(3)/(4).\n\n**Formula used :**\n\nBODMAS\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ [ ( 5(1)/(2) )² right. - left. ( 2(3)/(4) )² ]~ ÷ 2(3)/(4)\n\n**⇒ **[( 121/4 )-( 121/16 )] ÷ 11/4\n\n⇒ [(484 -121)/16 ] ÷ 11/4\n\n⇒ [363 /16] ÷ 11/4\n\n⇒ (363/16) × (4/11) = 33/4 = 8(1)/(4)\n\n**∴ The value is **8(1)/(4)**.**",
